  "_about": "Game terms stay in English in every translation. 'keep': always kept, in any form (minion/minions, Avatar/avatars), and checked: a Codex translation that drops one is not kept. 'keep_when_game_term': card actions and words that are also everyday words (tap, attack, draw, site, power ...) -- kept in English where they mean the game's action or thing, translated where they are ordinary words (tap the screen, the official site). 'terms': fixed translations for anything else, as \"English\": \"translation\". 'notes': how to write the language.",
